\b\fs24 1. Gemma\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cf1\f1 Gemma\cell It's been a while since we were last here together, hasn't it? Why don't we try climbing the Tor again\emdash for old times' sake?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Well, that was a bit of a surprise, wasn't it? Haven't you got big and strong, though!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Hey, since we've come this far, would you mind going up to the top of the Tor again with me? We can take in the view, for old times' sake.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I know you'll be heading off on plenty more adventures, and doing all kinds of stuff I can't even imagine...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell But I'll always be here, you know. And when you've finally finished saving the world, I'll be waiting\emdash waiting for you to come home at last...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Are we heading back to Cobblestone, then?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> and Gemma make their way back to the village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Oh, I'm just so happy! Recreating our wedding up on the Tor was wonderful! I'm so glad you agreed to do it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...But you look exhausted. You shouldn't push yourself so hard, you know. Anyway, now you're back, you can have a nice rest. Are you ready to turn in?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Goodnight then, darling! Have yourself a lovely sleep, won't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Morning, darling! It was so nice spending time with you\emdash I only wish you could stay longer. ...But I know that's not how things are right now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell You don't have to worry about me\emdash I'll be just fine here with my new mother-in-law! Hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell You're full of beans, aren't you? I know! Why don't we go for a walk around the village?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Oh, I'm so happy! Well, lead the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Alright. Well, we can do something next time you're home. Take care out there...darling!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Wouldn't it be really lovely to go away somewhere together when you've finally finished saving the world?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I'd really love to relax in the famous bathhouse of Hotto and forget all my worries... Oh, but the beach at Puerto Valor sounds wonderful too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Not that it matters, of course\emdash as long as I'm with you, it doesn't matter where we go!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I hope you're wearing the charm I gave you, darling!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell That way, even when we're apart, you'll always have a reminder of your happy home here!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Oh, sweetheart, I've had the most wonderful idea!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell You know that J\f0\'f6rmun? The great big sweetie you brought here to be the town mascot? Well, I've been thinking of making little dollies of him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell They'd make perfect souvenirs for visitors to Cobblestone! What do you think? It's a lovely idea, isn't it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I've got a question for you! Am I your oldest and bestest friend Gemma?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell WRONG! I'm not your friend any more\f1\emdash\f0 I'm your wife! Hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Hee hee! I knew you'd get it right! I'm not your friend any more, of course\f1\emdash\f0 I'm your darling wife!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Anyway, that's enough of my silly jokes! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I'm still getting used to cooking for two. I keep making far too much food!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell But then I don't want you going hungry, do I, darling?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I still can't believe how tidy you are, darling! You never leave old socks lying about or dirty plates or anything!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I probably have your mother to thank for that! Didn't she bring you up well!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell It's amazing how tough and grown-up you've become, darling!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell But then, I s'pose you're not a boy any more\f1\emdash\f0 you're a man of the world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Um, darling... I'm a little shy about saying it, but there's something I want you to know...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Being with you is the best thing that ever happened to me, and I love every second we spend together! There\f1\emdash\f0 I said it! ...I hope you feel the same!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell ...Hee hee! Oh, but just listen to me! I'm sure you must be exhausted. Are you ready to call it a day?<yesno>\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\par
\b\f0\fs24\lang1033 2. Erik\b0\f1\fs22\lang9\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So this is the famous tor, huh? Well, it'd be a waste to come all this way and not see the view from the top\emdash come on, <pc>, let's do this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Monsters, huh? Come on, <pc>\emdash let's do this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Well, that was annoying. Still, there was no way those chumps were ever going to take us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell We've already come this far. Why don't we check out the top of the Tor while we're here?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell We haven't found even half the treasure that's out there yet.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I say we hunt it all down, split the take, and retire rich men. Deal?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Yeah, I guess it is about time we headed back to Cobblestone. Shall we?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> and Erik make their way back to the village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hey! You know something? Cobblestone's great! All this fresh country air\emdash I can feel myself getting healthier by the second!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So are you hitting the hay or what?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Good plan. I'm about ready to turn in myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Morning! I don't know about you, but I slept like a log! I'm ready for anything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Yeah, I guess it is still kind of early. What say we head out for a wander?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Some of the locals have been telling me about the Tor. I'd kind of like to check it out. What do you say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Nice! Well, let's head south and see what it's all about!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Not in the mood, huh? Well, alright. We'll save the hiking expedition for another time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So are you hitting the hay or what?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Good plan. I'm about ready to turn in myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Morning! Don't know about you but I slept like a log! I'm ready for anything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Yeah, I guess it is still kind of early. What say we head out for a wander?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Some of the locals have been telling me about the Tor. I'd kind of like to check it out. What do you say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Nice! Well, let's head south and see what it's all about!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Not in the mood, huh? Well, alright. We'll save the hiking expedition for another time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Tell Erik you think you've walked enough?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Erik heads back home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> finishes his walk with Erik and gets back to his adventure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's a picture of <pc> standing with his companions. They all look very happy. Take a closer look?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\f0 Erik\cell So that little stroll up to the Tor was pretty fun\f1\emdash\f0 I mean, sure, I nearly fell to my death, but it keeps things interesting, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Well, anyway\f1\emdash\f0 you look about ready to hit the hay. Bedtime?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Good plan. I'm about ready to turn in myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Morning! I don't know about you, but I slept like a log! I'm ready for anything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Yeah, I guess it is still kind of early. What say we head out for a wander round the village?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Nice! Let's head out and see what we can see!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Not in the mood, huh? Well, alright. We'll save it for another time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell You know, I never really had the opportunity to do much cooking before I started living here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell But now I'm taking every chance I get to hone my skills in the kitchen! Your mom's already taught me a bunch of great recipes. Next time, I'll rustle up something that'll knock your socks off!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Anyhow, I guess we'll have plenty of time to talk about cooking some other time. You look about ready to hit the hay\f1\emdash\f0 bedtime?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Man, I still can't get over how peaceful this place is. I mean, there's no crime, no one fights... When I think of the way I used to live, it feels like a dream.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Sometimes I even forget that I used to steal stuff for a living. I guess what I mean to say is that life here's pretty darned good!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Anyway, maybe we've chewed the fat enough for one day. You look about ready to hit the hay\f1\emdash\f0 bedtime?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hey, I was just thinking about that stew we made on our first night here. That was quite something, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
