\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, darling, it completely slipped my mind\f1\emdash\f0 your pyjama bottoms had a big rip in them, so I grabbed my trusty needle and thread and sewed them up, good as new!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I'm far too modest to talk about it, of course, but I'm a real whizz when it comes to needlework.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
