\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, sweetie, I don't think I've ever felt this relaxed in my life! Spending time in Cobblestone is pure bliss! I've been sleeping like a baby.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell It's worked wonders for my complexion. When I looked at myself in the mirror this morning, I was so bright-eyed and bushy-tailed it was all I could do to stop myself from kissing my reflection!\par
