\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You know what Cobblestone is missing, darling? A dedicated event space\f1\emdash\f0 I was thinking of a kind of cross between a circus tent and a theatre.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Imagine! After all, the location is just perfect! I can see entertainers flocking here from around the world! Ahh, the sky's the limit, I'm telling you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
