\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I do hope you enjoyed that little lunch box I prepared for you, darling. I don't know if you noticed, but I cut the lettuce leaves into little heart shapes, just for you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
