\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I still can't quite believe how peaceful it is here. At night, you really can't hear a thing. I really feel at one with nature.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I'm hoping all this healthy living and fresh air will give me inspiration for new ways to put smiles on people's faces!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
