\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell How about joining me for an early morning constitutional tomorrow, laddie? Ye're wasting the best part of the day lying about in bed like ye do.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, we can talk about all this and more tomorrow. I'll warrant ye're about ready to turn in, eh?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So I heard from yer mother that you and Chalky were always sneaking off and going fishing when ye were a bairn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, if ever ye fancy a wee angle, I'm yer man. I'm no slouch with a rod, I tell ye!\par
