\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye know something, laddie\f1\emdash\f0 you look a lot less anxious now we're back where ye grew up. It's not surprising, I suppose, surrounded by all this natural beauty. Anyway, it's good to see ye relax a little.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Yer auld man was pretty highly strung himself, now I come to think about it. I remember before ye were born, he worked himself into a right auld lather trying to think of a name for ye.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
