\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I forgot to mention that Dunstan invited me to dinner the other day. Don't worry\f1\emdash\f0 ye're more than welcome to come too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell He says he's going to serve us the best fish we'll ever eat, and I for one cannae wait! Aye, I have to say that life here in Cobblestone agrees with me something fierce!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
