\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye know, laddie, yer old pal Gemma really is a wee gem. The other day, she was good enough to give me a shoulder rub. I felt like a new man!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Would it be too much to ask for my own grandson to rub my shoulders once in a while? Ye'd be making an auld man very happy...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
