\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ever since disaster struck Dundrasil, I've had to fend for myself. After being waited on hand and foot all my life, I suddenly had no choice but to teach myself how to cook and wash my own socks and what have ye.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So if ye've any worries about yer auld grandad pulling his weight, put them out of yer wee head. I know how to fold a sheet and whip up a tasty stew, don't you worry!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Anyway, we can talk about all this and more tomorrow. I'll warrant ye're about ready to turn in, eh?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Cobblestone's the perfect place to catch up on yer reading. The only thing likely to disturb ye is the sound of wee bairns running about the place. But I cannae begrudge them their youthful high spirits.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1374\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell In fact, it takes me back to my own youth. I was full of beans too. Come to think of it, I'm not sure I've changed a whole lot! I could still give those wee'uns a run for their money!\par
